### Verifier endpoints
### Verify is public; history requires role VERIFIER.
### Flip via psql: UPDATE users SET role='VERIFIER' WHERE email='verifier@test.edu';
@host = http://localhost:6969
@envelopePath = /tmp/opencode/envelope.json

### Verify a credential (public, multipart; file from holder download)
POST {{host}}/api/verifier/verify
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="credentialFile"; filename="envelope.json"
Content-Type: application/json

< {{envelopePath}}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Login as verifier (captures accessToken)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "verifier@test.edu",
  "password": "TestPass-123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("authToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Verification history (own, newest first)
GET {{host}}/api/verifier/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}